    question: 'TD-VG-E-29 says goldens with production move once in this piece\'s Goldens step, old and new named. TD-VG-E-26 lists 21 pytest ids known-red until VG-E-startforce re-records them (VG-E-startforce lands AFTER this piece). A golden that this piece moves AND that is already red for the E7 reason cannot be re-recorded here (it would stay red; its new value depends on startforce). Also a golden file with no owner row in the VG-E-prodslot row cannot be edited (footprint fence).',
